icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Teleportation\" title=\"Shadow Teleportation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Shadow_Step_Icon.webp/40px-Shadow_Step_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Shadow_Step_Icon.webp/60px-Shadow_Step_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Shadow_Step_Icon.webp/80px-Shadow_Step_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Teleportation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Shadow_Step_Icon.webp/40px-Shadow_Step_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Shadow_Step_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Teleportation\" title=\"Shadow Teleportation\">Shadow Teleportation</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Teleport to an unoccupied, obscured spot. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>     \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item is not accessible through normal gameplay, but can still be accessed via third party tools.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203429\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.085 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.091 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1760/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24861/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6237/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1603/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.034/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1499458/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   80.255      1 -total\n 65.18%   52.312      1 Template:EquipmentPage\n 34.76%   27.900      1 Template:Inaccessible\n 34.26%   27.493      1 Template:Inaccessible/internal\n 33.33%   26.752      1 Template:Ambox\n 15.58%   12.506      1 Template:SpellAction\n 14.45%   11.596      2 Template:Uid\n 11.96%    9.598      6 Template:Icon_text\n 10.05%    8.065     17 Template:Trim\n  8.16%    6.548      1 Template:Spell_action/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30958-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203429 and revision id 394599. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}